{"id": "dev_math_002", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 82, "small_out_tokens": 116, "big_in_tokens": 67, "big_out_tokens": 538, "small_raw_response": "To find the profit, we need to first find the new value of the house after the repairs. The original value was $80,000, and the repairs increased the value by 150%. \n\n150% of $80,000 is 1.5 x $80,000 = $120,000. \n\nThe new value of the house is $80,000 + $120,000 = $200,000. \n\nJosh spent $50,000 on repairs, so his profit is $200,000 - $50,000 = $150,000.", "big_raw_response": "70000", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_003", "small_ok": true, "big_ok": false, "small_in_tokens": 67, "small_out_tokens": 35, "big_in_tokens": 0, "big_out_tokens": 0, "small_raw_response": "3 sprints * 3 times/week = 9 sprints/week\n9 sprints/week * 60 meters/sprint = 540 meters/week", "big_raw_response": "", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_004", "small_ok": true, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 141, "small_out_tokens": 66, "big_in_tokens": 121, "big_out_tokens": 463, "small_raw_response": "Total feed given so far = 15 + 25 = 40 cups\nFeed per chicken per meal = 3 cups\nNumber of chickens = 20\nTotal feed needed per day = 3 * 20 = 60 cups\nFeed left for the final meal = 60 - 40 = 20 cups", "big_raw_response": "20", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_005", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 87, "small_out_tokens": 296, "big_in_tokens": 64, "big_out_tokens": 244, "small_raw_response": "To find the total cost, we need to calculate the cost of the glasses with the discount.\n\nCost of 1 glass: $5\nCost of 2 glasses: $5 x 2 = $10\nCost of 3 glasses: $5 x 2 = $10\nCost of 4 glasses: $5 x 2 = $10\nCost of 5 glasses: $5 x 2 = $10\nCost of 6 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 7 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 8 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 9 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 10 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 11 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 12 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 13 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 14 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 15 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\nCost of 16 glasses: $5 x 1.6 = $8\n\nTotal cost: $5 x 8 + $8 = $40 + $8 = $48", "big_raw_response": "64", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_006", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 74, "small_out_tokens": 41, "big_in_tokens": 52, "big_out_tokens": 234, "small_raw_response": "Toulouse: 2 x 4 x 20 = 80\nCharleston: 4 x 20 = 80\nTotal: 80 + 80 + 20 = 180", "big_raw_response": "260", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_003", "small_ok": true, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 67, "small_out_tokens": 35, "big_in_tokens": 44, "big_out_tokens": 171, "small_raw_response": "3 sprints * 3 times/week = 9 sprints/week\n9 sprints/week * 60 meters/sprint = 540 meters/week", "big_raw_response": "540", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_007", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 99, "small_out_tokens": 84, "big_in_tokens": 80, "big_out_tokens": 467, "small_raw_response": "To find the total time, we need to calculate the time it takes to download 60% of the file and then add the time for the restart.\n\nTime to download 60% of the file: 0.6 x 200 GB / 2 GB/minute = 60 minutes\n\nTime for the restart: 20 minutes\n\nTotal time: 60 minutes + 20 minutes = 80 minutes", "big_raw_response": "160", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_008", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 134, "small_out_tokens": 214, "big_in_tokens": 114, "big_out_tokens": 697, "small_raw_response": "To find the distance John is from home at the end of those 4 hours, we need to calculate the distance he traveled in each segment of his trip.\n\n1. The first 3 hours at 60 mph:\nDistance = Speed x Time = 60 x 3 = 180 miles\n\n2. The 2 hours of standstill traffic:\nDistance = Speed x Time = 0 x 2 = 0 miles\n\n3. The 0.5 hours (30 minutes) at 30 mph:\nDistance = Speed x Time = 30 x 0.5 = 15 miles\n\n4. The remaining 2.5 hours (150 minutes) at 80 mph:\nDistance = Speed x Time = 80 x 2.5 = 200 miles\n\nTotal distance traveled = 180 + 0 + 15 + 200 = 395 miles\n\nSince John drove 180 miles away from home initially, he is now 395 - 180 = 215 miles away from home at the end of those 4 hours.", "big_raw_response": "45", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_009", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 90, "small_out_tokens": 104, "big_in_tokens": 70, "big_out_tokens": 134, "small_raw_response": "To find Eliza's earnings for this week, we need to calculate her earnings for the first 40 hours and the overtime hours.\n\nEarnings for the first 40 hours: 40 x $10 = $400\n\nOvertime hours: 45 - 40 = 5 hours\nOvertime rate: 1.2 x $10 = $12\nEarnings for overtime hours: 5 x $12 = $60\n\nTotal earnings for this week: $400 + $60 = $460", "big_raw_response": "460", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_010", "small_ok": true, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 91, "small_out_tokens": 79, "big_in_tokens": 70, "big_out_tokens": 421, "small_raw_response": "To find the total downloads, we need to calculate the downloads for each month:\n\nMonth 1: 60 downloads\nMonth 2: 3 x 60 = 180 downloads\nMonth 3: 180 - (30% of 180) = 180 - 54 = 126 downloads\n\nTotal downloads: 60 + 180 + 126 = 366 downloads", "big_raw_response": "366", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_011", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 95, "small_out_tokens": 36, "big_in_tokens": 72, "big_out_tokens": 273, "small_raw_response": "3 * $68 = $204\n2 * $80 = $160\n6 * $55 = $330\n$204 + $160 + $330 = $714", "big_raw_response": "694", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
{"id": "dev_math_012", "small_ok": false, "big_ok": true, "small_in_tokens": 99, "small_out_tokens": 244, "big_in_tokens": 76, "big_out_tokens": 1793, "small_raw_response": "Year 1: - $90 + $10.5 = -$79.5\nYear 2: -$79.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = -$59\nYear 3: -$59 + $10.5 + $10.5 = -$38.5\nYear 4: -$38.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = -$18\nYear 5: -$18 + $10.5 + $10.5 = $2.5\nYear 6: $2.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = $23.5\nYear 7: $23.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = $44.5\nYear 8: $44.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = $65.5\nYear 9: $65.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = $86.5\nYear 10: $86.5 + $10.5 + $10.5 = $107.5\n\nIt will take 10 years for Carlos to start earning money on the lemon tree.", "big_raw_response": "13", "small_model": "llama3.2:3b", "big_model": "gemini-3.5-flash"}
